{"municipality_code":"22133","pref":"静岡県","city":"浜松市西区","headline":"街道の街の雰囲気が感じられ、村の境界の痕跡も見つかるかもしれません。","display_comment_enriched":"浜松市西区には、江戸期の堀江藩と堀江城跡・堀江陣屋跡に連なる領主・城下の記憶が残っています。 周辺には史跡や遺跡、寺社や信仰の場にまつわる場所が点在し、「角江遺跡」、「大平遺跡」、「堀江城跡・堀江陣屋跡」などを起点に歩くと、地域の歴史がぐっと見えやすくなります。 現地では城跡・陣屋跡、史跡説明板が、地域の歴史を読み解く手がかりになるでしょう。 さらに堀江藩にゆかりのある領主碑や旧領境のしるべも、現地で探してみたい歴史の手がかりです。 人物に目を向けるなら、武将・武士の結城秀康との縁をたどることで、街の歴史をより立体的に楽しめます。 「堀江城」や「舘山寺」などの名所も、地域の物語を深掘りする絶好の入口です。","radar_groups":[{"id":"town","title":"街の基盤","metrics":[{"id":"dining","label":"飲食店","short_label":"飲食","count":194,"rank":411,"percentile":78.4,"national_average":234.0,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"parks","label":"公園・遊具","short_label":"公園","count":51,"rank":384,"percentile":79.6,"national_average":35.1,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"public","label":"公共施設","short_label":"公共","count":30,"rank":852,"percentile":53.4,"national_average":39.8,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"culture","label":"文化施設","short_label":"文化","count":34,"rank":93,"percentile":94.7,"national_average":12.5,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"landscape","label":"景観・樹木","short_label":"景観","count":0,"rank":null,"percentile":0.0,"national_average":0.2,"municipality_total":1896}]},{"id":"history","title":"歴史資産","metrics":[{"id":"temples_shrines","label":"寺社仏閣","short_label":"寺社","count":5,"rank":776,"percentile":53.6,"national_average":8.9,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"historic_sites","label":"史跡・遺跡","short_label":"史跡","count":6,"rank":699,"percentile":57.7,"national_average":7.8,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"roads_posts","label":"街道・宿場","short_label":"街道","count":2,"rank":320,"percentile":69.8,"national_average":1.2,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"villages","label":"近世村","short_label":"近世村","count":28,"rank":638,"percentile":65.6,"national_average":31.5,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"civil","label":"土木遺産","short_label":"土木","count":0,"rank":null,"percentile":0.0,"national_average":0.3,"municipality_total":1896}]}],"culture_cards":{"notable_people":["結